flowchart TD
    A[User or JSON Scenario] --> B[Input Loader]
    B --> C[Validation Guardrails]
    C -->|Invalid| D[Blocked Result + Human-readable Error]
    C -->|Valid| E[PawPal Planning Agent]
    E --> F[Specialize Priorities]
    F --> G[Rank Tasks]
    G --> H[Construct Schedule]
    H --> I[Self-Critique]
    I --> J{Revision Needed?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Revise Safety Ordering]
    J -->|No| L[Keep Draft]
    K --> M[Confidence Scoring]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Schedule + Warnings + Unscheduled Tasks]
    N --> O[Human Review]
    N --> P[Saved Agent Trace]
    Q[Evaluation Harness / Pytest] --> C
    Q --> E
    Q --> M
